#: includes/settings/class-wc-checkoutcom-cards-settings.php:902
msgid "Step 1: Payment Processing Certificate Setup (for decryption)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-wc-checkoutcom-cards-settings.php:904
msgid "Set up your Apple Pay Payment Processing Certificate. This certificate is required for Checkout.com to decrypt Apple Pay payment tokens. Follow the steps below to generate and upload your certificate."
